

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:2
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_bc8337af:

    # "While moving around the camp, I picked up a distinct scent that made me stop in my tracks."
    "在营地走动时，一股特殊气味让我骤然止步。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:3
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_627fb527:

    # "As I looked around, I listened carefully, and for a moment, I thought perhaps I was wrong; perhaps there was nothing there."
    "我环顾四周仔细聆听，一度以为可能是错觉——那里空无一物。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:4
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_99f44af8:

    # "Then I heard it, that distinct {i}hissing{/i} sound, calling to me."
    "随后便听见了——那独特的{i}嘶嘶声{/i}在呼唤我。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:12
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_167176ed:

    # "Following the voice towards the outskirts of the camp, I found the Skalith waiting for me."
    "循声来到营地外围，发现那只斯卡利斯正等候着我。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:13
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_006492e1:

    # "She let out a low rumble when she saw me, but my eyes were naturally drawn to the round, pregnant belly she tenderly rubbed at."
    "她见我时发出低沉喉音，但我的目光自然落在她轻抚的浑圆孕肚上。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:14
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_009ace1c:

    # MC @ surprised "You're-"
    MC @ surprised "你——"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:15
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_d346991d:

    # "I stopped myself. The girl didn't seem to register my words, but she understood my surprise."
    "我咽回话语。她虽不懂言语，却明白我的震惊。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:17
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_c1fa40b4:

    # "Stepping forward, she tenderly placed my hands onto her belly for a moment, letting me feel the child moving around inside."
    "她上前将我的手轻按在她腹部，让我感受其中胎儿的活动。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:18
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_22694b3a:

    # "As I looked up to her to meet her eyes, she stepped back, turning tail to flee into the distance!"
    "当我抬头迎上她目光时，她却后退转身向远方逃去！"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:20
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_4f4f1287:

    # MC "Wait! Stop!"
    MC "等等！别走！"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:21
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_7a0856e3:

    # MC @ serious "(That Skalith... It came to see me to let me know she carried my child?)"
    MC @ serious "(那只斯卡利斯...是专程来告知她怀了我的孩子？)"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:22
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_pregnant_a1a776b2:

    # MC @ think "(I thought those things were just mindless killers?)"
    MC @ think "(我以为它们只是无脑的杀戮机器？)"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:26
