# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:37
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_e8c0c1b0:

    # "She let out a low rumble when she saw me, but my eyes were naturally drawn to the small, gurgling, lizard-like child in her arms."
    "她见我时发出低沉喉音，但我的目光自然落在她怀中咯咯作响的蜥蜴般幼崽身上。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:38
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_c9d45596:

    # MC @ surprised "Is that our-"
    MC @ surprised "那是我们的——"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:39
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_8ffded9c:

    # "The Skalith rumbled soothingly in approval, her eyes filled towards me with... {i}adoration?{/i}"
    "斯卡利斯发出认可的安抚声，眼中盈满对我的...{i}爱慕？{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:41
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_4811bb6d:

    # "Stepping forward, she let me look closer at our child, who sleepily reached out to grab at one of my fingers and squeeze it tightly."
    "她上前让我细看我们的孩子，小家伙睡眼惺忪地伸手抓住我的手指紧握着。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:42
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_84ef6b8d:

    # "Gently, I found my Skalith's mate's clawed hands gently cupping over my crotch as she lightly rubbed against it."
    "我察觉她的利爪正轻轻覆上我的胯部摩挲。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:43
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_1addb147:

    # "Her body secreted that same powerful scent to tell me her intentions without even saying a word."
    "她身体散发出熟悉的浓烈气息，无需言语便表明了意图。"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:44
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_5d7be6df:

    # "{i}She wants more offspring, she wants to keep mating...{/i}"
    "{i}她渴望更多后代，想要继续交配...{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/lizards_camp_visit.rpy:45
translate zh travel_event_lizard_camp_visit_gavebirth_da91d3d4:

    # "We looked into each other's eyes for a moment before she finally stepped back, turning tail to flee into the distance. She hurried off with our child, leaving me to contemplate her...{i}proposal.{/i}"
    "我们相视片刻后，她终于后退转身向远方奔去。她带着我们的孩子匆匆离开，留我思索她的...{i}提议{/i}。"